{
  "_comment": "Broadcast task (requested_assignee empty) so RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rule 2a is reachable: w1 declines before anyone is assigned, which MUST NOT bar w2 from accepting (no policy is bound, so allow_reassignment_on_reject is not in play and MUST NOT be what decides it), and w1 can never accept afterwards.",
  "mode": "macp.mode.task.v1",
  "initiator": "agent://planner",
  "participants": [
    "agent://planner",
    "agent://w1",
    "agent://w2",
    "agent://w3"
  ],
  "mode_version": "1.0.0",
  "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
  "policy_version": "",
  "ttl_ms": 60000,
  "messages": [
    {
      "sender": "agent://w1",
      "message_type": "TaskRequest",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskRequestPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "title": "Build",
        "instructions": "Do it",
        "requested_assignee": "",
        "deadline_unix_ms": 0
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://planner",
      "message_type": "TaskRequest",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskRequestPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "title": "Build",
        "instructions": "Do it",
        "requested_assignee": "",
        "deadline_unix_ms": 0
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://planner",
      "message_type": "TaskRequest",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskRequestPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t2",
        "title": "Another",
        "instructions": "Do more",
        "requested_assignee": "",
        "deadline_unix_ms": 0
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rules 2 and 2a: an eligible participant MAY decline a broadcast task while no assignee is active; it records w1's decline only.",
      "sender": "agent://w1",
      "message_type": "TaskReject",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskRejectPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "assignee": "agent://w1",
        "reason": "busy"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rule 2a: a participant that has declined MUST NOT later send TaskAccept. No assignee is active yet, so rule 3a does not apply and this rejection isolates rule 2a.",
      "sender": "agent://w1",
      "message_type": "TaskAccept",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskAcceptPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "assignee": "agent://w1",
        "reason": "changed my mind"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rule 2: on a broadcast task only an eligible declared participant may send TaskAccept; mallory is not in participants. No assignee is active yet, so rule 3a does not apply.",
      "sender": "agent://mallory",
      "message_type": "TaskAccept",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskAcceptPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "assignee": "agent://mallory",
        "reason": "ready"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rules 2a and 3a: w1's decline does not change w2's eligibility, so w2's first TaskAccept designates it the active assignee.",
      "sender": "agent://w2",
      "message_type": "TaskAccept",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskAcceptPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "assignee": "agent://w2",
        "reason": "ready"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rules 2a and 3a: w1 declined, and an assignee is now active.",
      "sender": "agent://w1",
      "message_type": "TaskAccept",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskAcceptPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "assignee": "agent://w1",
        "reason": "ready now"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 4 and Section 5 rule 4: TaskUpdate does not carry an explicit assignee field -- authorship is validated via the Envelope sender, which MUST match the active assignee. A non-assignee sender (here, the requester) MUST be rejected.",
      "sender": "agent://planner",
      "message_type": "TaskUpdate",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskUpdatePayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "status": "in_progress",
        "progress": 0.5,
        "message": "requester is not the active assignee"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://w2",
      "message_type": "TaskUpdate",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskUpdatePayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "status": "in_progress",
        "progress": 0.5,
        "message": "halfway through"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rule 3a: w3 is eligible and has never declined, but w2 is already the active assignee. Isolates rule 3a from rule 2a, which also applies to w1's attempt above.",
      "sender": "agent://w3",
      "message_type": "TaskAccept",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskAcceptPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "assignee": "agent://w3",
        "reason": "ready"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rule 3b: the active assignee MUST NOT send TaskReject after TaskAccept. No policy is bound, so allow_reassignment_on_reject is false.",
      "sender": "agent://w2",
      "message_type": "TaskReject",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskRejectPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "assignee": "agent://w2",
        "reason": "busy"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rule 4: TaskComplete MUST come from the active assignee (w2).",
      "sender": "agent://w1",
      "message_type": "TaskComplete",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskCompletePayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "assignee": "agent://w1",
        "output": "result",
        "summary": "done"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rule 4: TaskFail MUST come from the active assignee; the requester is not it.",
      "sender": "agent://planner",
      "message_type": "TaskFail",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.task.v1.TaskFailPayload",
      "payload": {
        "task_id": "t1",
        "assignee": "agent://planner",
        "error_code": "BUILD_FAILED",
        "reason": "compilation error",
        "retryable": false
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0009 Section 5 rule 5: Commitment is eligible only after TaskComplete or TaskFail. Neither has been accepted.",
      "sender": "agent://planner",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c1",
        "action": "task.completed",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "done",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.default",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
        "outcome_positive": true
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    }
  ],
  "expected_final_state": "Open"
}
